// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P753352125" "Enter Sharkhead Isle"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1210802375" "Enter Talos Island through the Rift Enclosure"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Caption :
"P3891809161" "<t=5 x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Your time in Praetoria is coming to an end..."
// 3 Caption :
"P1161882442" "<t=5 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>... and now, the choice of your new life in Primal Earth lays before you."
// 7 Caption :
"P853940405" "<t=7 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>The only way for Calvin Scott and the Resistance to defeat Cole is to gain the aid of those from Primal Earth..."
// 7 Caption :
"P3980706259" "<t=7 x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Will you go to Paragon City to try and earn their help and defend them from Cole's mass invasion?"
// 7 Caption :
"P267196930" "<t=7 x= 0.8 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Or will you go to the Rogue Isles to seek your own power and glory to use for yourself, or whatever cause you may believe in?"
// LeftText :
"P3707248008" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Go to Paragon City</color></scale><br><br><color Paragon>Become a Hero</color></span><br><br>The only way the Resistance is going to bring down Cole is with the help of the supers from Primal Earth. If you can show them that there <i>are</i> good people in Praetoria who need their help, you can convince them to join the war effort. They'll see that their planet is the only one at risk and join together to face the might of Emperor Cole and his army.<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As your own story unfolds on Primal Earth, you will have opportunities to switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P4268551774" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Go to the Rogue Isles</color></scale><br><br><color red>Become a Villain</color></span><br><br>The people of Primal Earth think everyone in Praetoria is a monster. Why would you try to convince them otherwise, when you can focus on building up your own powerbase within the Rogue Isles? There, you can do whatever you wish. Maim, destroy, blow up anyone who stands in your way, or perhaps form your own group. The possibilities there are endless.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As your own story unfolds on Primal Earth, you will have opportunities to switch sides.)</scale></i>"
